<h1>Start the program Find.Same.Images.OK select the options, if you want to compare folders with folders or Compare all! </h1>
<br>
Press the "Start" button and simply start the search for the double and similarly images. Set the similarity tolerance before you start the scan ergo search.<br>
<br>
You can also activate the options rotated, flipped (mirrored) and negative image search if necessary!<br>
<br>
When the image search is completed, you can select the images in FSI.OK by checking the check boxes and then select the desired operation in the list view contextmenu. Or you just let the worse or better pictures by the program itself.<br>
<br>
